        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">SolarEdge Energy Bank 10.3 kWh</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">baterija; baterija [350, 450] V; komunikacija: SolarEdge Home Network (brezžično, plug-in in antena v razsmerniku), RS485 (G, A, B, En) - samo če Home Network ni mogoč</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: SolarEdge Home Battery 400V For Europe BAT-10K1P - datasheet, DS-000164-EU, 9. 7. 2024 (stolpec BAT-10K1PS0B-x2); kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: goodenergy.co.uk) str. 2; Energy Bank SolarEdge, Batteria da 10 kWh, per l'Europa BAT-10K1PS0B-01 - datasheet (IT), DS-000051-1.5-IT, 08/2021 (Energia totale 10300 Wh); kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: files.rexel.it) str. 2; SolarEdge Home Battery 400V Installation and Operation Guide, Europe, v1.0, september 2022; kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: res.cloudinary.com/gpceurope) str. 1 (koraki 1-6: montaža, MC4 DC+/DC-, ozemljitev 7,5 Nm, 121 kg, 50 m), 2 (varnost, 350-450 Vdc); Application Note: SolarEdge Energy Bank Connection and Configuration, v1.0 (RS485 konektor baterije G, A, B, En; DC 10 AWG); kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: ressupply.com), Severna Amerika str. 1-2; SolarEdge Home Battery 400V Quick Installation Guide, v1.1, januar 2025, North America (za BAT-10K1PS0B-02; samo navzkrižna kontrola DC+/DC- in ozemljitve); kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: ressupply.com) str. 1</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">119</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">790</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">1179</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">250</elementInformation>
